#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 気にしてもしょうがない、放っておこう。
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's not much point in worrying about it now. I\n"
"should try to just forget about it..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ここから出ても、
#. しばらくは監視カメラがトラウマになりそうだな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Assuming I make it out of here alive, I'll never look\n"
"at surveillance cameras the same way again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>カーペットのシミも消えてるし、
#. ポスターもグラビアアイドルのものになってる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The coffee stains on the carpet are gone, and the\n"
"bikini model poster is back...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>舞園さんたちの時と同じ…
#. モノクマがやったんだろうな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's just like with Sayaka. Monokuma must have done\n"
"it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件には…ここは関係ないよな…
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "This area has nothing to do with the case this time..."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>男子更衣室から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the boys locker room?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
